{"ts": "2026-10-26T18:41:06.488969Z", "run_id": "r-20261026T1813Z-f0d4", "unit": "openspec:audit-chain-verifiable", "seq": 127, "type": "delegate.result", "question": "Q-005", "id": "Q-005", "status": "answered", "reason": "I read the test file at the unit's head: it is the pre-change version, with no datetime import, no mintkey-models sys.path entry, and AuditEvent built without at. I read apps/audit-verify-job/verify.py: _chain_event raises ValueError when event.at is None, and both compute_event_hash and verify_chain go through it, so _build_chain raises on its first event. tasks.md 2.1 explicitly requires the set-up change to that file and is marked done. The finding is therefore correct and not waivable; the fix is the set-up change the task states, which the task itself unfreezes, so it is not a frozen test file.", "called": true, "tasks": [], "target": "F-0b7e7198", "kind": "verdict", "profile": "delegate-fable", "model": "claude-fable-5-1", "cli": "claude-code", "cost_usd": 0.9782059999999999, "decision": "reject", "answer_sha256": "d4367ae9f7f8fca38be8c192ab16855d96a4a43177335ce8ebeb84fd888e1740", "checked": [{"ref": "tests/unit/audit_verify/test_chain_verify.py:50", "quote": "event = AuditEvent(\n            id=\"evt_\" + str(i).zfill(3),\n            event_type=\"test.event\",\n            tenant_id=tenant_id,\n            payload=payload,\n            hash=b\"\\x00\" * 32,   # placeholder, filled below\n            prev_hash=prev,\n        )", "claim": "The test's _build_chain still constructs AuditEvent without an at value, so at defaults to None."}, {"ref": "tests/unit/audit_verify/test_chain_verify.py:20", "quote": "REPO_ROOT = os.path.abspath(os.path.join(os.path.dirname(__file__), \"../../..\"))\nVERIFY_JOB_DIR = os.path.join(REPO_ROOT, \"apps/audit-verify-job\")\nif VERIFY_JOB_DIR not in sys.path:\n    sys.path.insert(0, VERIFY_JOB_DIR)", "claim": "The file's set-up only adds the verify-job directory to sys.path, not packages/python/mintkey-models as task 2.1 requires."}, {"ref": "apps/audit-verify-job/verify.py:71", "quote": "if event.at is None:\n        raise ValueError(\"event has no at\")", "claim": "The rewritten verify.py refuses an AuditEvent whose at is None, so _build_chain's compute_event_hash call raises."}, {"ref": "apps/audit-verify-job/verify.py:90", "quote": "def compute_event_hash(event: AuditEvent, prev_hash: bytes) -> bytes:", "claim": "compute_event_hash delegates through _chain_event, which performs the at check."}, {"ref": "tests/conftest.py:28", "quote": "_REPO_ROOT / \"packages/python/mintkey-models\",", "claim": "The shared conftest adds mintkey-models to sys.path under pytest, so the import works there, but the test file itself still lacks the entry task 2.1 asks for."}]}
